 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon GameLift Streams API (2018-05-10). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Applications are configuration metadata that stay INITIALIZED: no content is copied from Amazon S3, replicated, processed or streamed, and nothing is written to ApplicationLogOutputUri. ApplicationSourceUri must be an Amazon S3 URI; runtime environments are stored without checking the supported versions. Stream groups, stream sessions, their connections, locations and file exports return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501, so applications are never associated with a stream group.",
  "title": "Amazon GameLift Streams (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2018-05-10"
 },
